 "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [301.28369140625, 88], "pos": [6717.64013671875, -1564.7069091796875], "widgets_values": ["{\n  \"high_level_description\": \"黄昏时分，一条宁静的河流蜿蜒穿过乡村，水面上停泊着古朴的小船，岸边坐落着错落的农家小屋，天空中飘着形态柔和的云朵，宽幅远景构图营造出静谧治愈的田园诗意氛围。\",\n  \"style_description\": {\n    \"aesthetics\": [\"cinematic\", \"atmospheric\", \"serene\", \"high-end_fine_art_photography\", \"golden_hour\", \"moody\", \"timeless\"],\n    \"lighting\": \"warm golden hour side lighting, soft diffused sky glow, gentle water reflections, warm window light from farmhouses, subtle rim light on clouds, low contrast natural shadows\",\n    \"photo\": \"full frame DSLR photography, f/2.8 aperture, shallow depth of field, sharp foreground details, soft bokeh background, natural film grain, 8K ultra high resolution, long exposure water effect\",\n    \"medium\": \"photograph\",\n    \"color_palette\": [\"#FFB347\", \"#FF7F50\", \"#4682B4\", \"#87CEEB\", \"#F5F5DC\", \"#2F4F4F\", \"#8B4513\", \"#D2B48C\", \"#E6E6FA\", \"#CD853F\"]\n  },\n  \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n    \"background\": \"黄昏时分的乡村天空，淡蓝色的天幕上飘着形态舒展的云朵，被落日余晖染成暖橙与粉紫渐变；远处是连绵的浅绿田野与稀疏的树林，河流从远方蜿蜒而来，整体环境静谧悠远，带着淡淡的朦胧雾气。\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [350, 0, 950, 1000],\n        \"desc\": \"蜿蜒的乡村河流，水面平静如镜，清晰倒映着天空的晚霞与岸边的景物，有轻微的波纹荡漾，泛着金色的落日反光，河水呈现出深蓝与暖橙交织的色彩。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#4682B4\", \"#FFB347\", \"#87CEEB\", \"#2F4F4F\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [550, 350, 700, 550],\n        \"desc\": \"古朴的木质小船，船身呈深棕色，带有自然的磨损纹理，系在岸边的木桩上，静静地漂浮在水面上，船内空无一人，船舷边缘有轻微的水渍痕迹。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#8B4513\", \"#696969\", \"#D2B48C\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [250, 700, 450, 880],\n        \"desc\": \"错落有致的农家小屋，白墙黑瓦，屋顶有袅袅升起的淡灰色炊烟，木质门窗透出温暖的黄色灯光，院子周围围着低矮的竹篱笆，篱笆边生长着绿色的藤蔓植物。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#F5F5DC\", \"#2F4F4F\", \"#FFB347\", \"#228B22\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [0, 0, 1000, 400],\n        \"desc\": \"形态柔和的飘泊云朵，边缘被落日染成明亮的金色，主体呈现出暖橙与粉紫的渐变色彩，在淡蓝色的天空中舒展分布，云层轻薄通透。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#FFB347\", \"#E6E6FA\", \"#FF7F50\", \"#87CEEB\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [200, 600, 1000, 1000],\n        \"desc\": \"河流两岸的自然植被，包含深绿色的草地、低矮的灌木丛与几棵高大的树木，部分草叶呈现出秋日的黄绿色调，在黄昏的光线下显得柔和温暖。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#228B22\", \"#9ACD32\", \"#CD853F\", \"#8B4513\"]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 247, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 317, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 173, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.8.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 25}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [269], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [250, 80], "pos": [6726.70263671875, -1420.057861328125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 236, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 187, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.9.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 31}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "SIGMAS", "links": [241], "label": "SIGMAS", "type": "SIGMAS", "localized_name": "Sigmas"}], "size": [270, 240], "pos": [7555.36083984375, -662.9443969726562], "widgets_values": [20, 1024, 1024, 0.5, 1.7