ay, partial selective gilded coloring, shallow blended layer transition\",\n    \"medium\": \"photograph composite artwork\",\n    \"color_palette\": [\"#2C2C36\",\"#888888\",\"#D4AF37\",\"#FFD700\",\"#191919\",\"#E5E5E8\"]\n  },\n  \"compositional_deconstruction\": {\n    \"background\": \"低饱和冷灰纯色基底，细微胶片杂色颗粒质感，无多余杂物，突出双层叠加的人像与户外风景。\",\n    \"elements\": [\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [280, 25, 998, 998],\n        \"desc\": \"年轻男生半张面部特写，凌乱卷发，深邃棕瞳直视镜头，画面右半边人脸与衣身附着斑驳金箔裂纹肌理、细碎闪金颗粒，左半边脸部虚化融入户外山野场景，双曝光虚实融合。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#191919\",\"#888888\",\"#D4AF37\",\"#FFD700\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"obj\",\n        \"bbox\": [50, 550, 950, 998],\n        \"desc\": \"嵌在人像轮廓内的黄昏郊野场景：蜿蜒林间小路，两名黑衣人物剪影一前一后独自漫步，路边松柏与矮树丛，落日暖金光晕铺满路面与天际，整片风景镀上鎏金暖调。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#D4AF37\",\"#FFD700\",\"#2C2C36\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"bbox\": [65, 200, 525, 260],\n        \"text\": \"SILENCE\",\n        \"desc\": \"画面左上大号浅灰衬线英文，典雅复古字体，契合沉静主题。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#E5E5E8\"]\n      },\n      {\n        \"type\": \"text\",\n        \"bbox\": [55, 925, 245, 978],\n        \"text\": \"redcrow\",\n        \"desc\": \"画面左下角白色飘逸手写花体签名，作品标识落款。\",\n        \"color_palette\": [\"#FFFFFF\"]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 205, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 16}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-4581.95855799586, 2082.1301946432222], "scale": 0.6588450000000118}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 9, "title": "提示词（洗图不填写）", "bounding": [5475.50830078125, -1885.4129638